# sonair: the Keras engine sonair's keras framework runs on, and the Aim repository a tracker config writes to

# KERAS_BACKEND=torch   torch | tensorflow | jax — the engine Keras 3 runs on, read at import time; unset picks the first installed engine, and sonair.tensorflow pins tensorflow (README → Choosing the Keras compute backend)
# AIM_REPO=/path/to/aim   folder of the Aim repository an AimTracker config writes to via `save_dir: $AIM_REPO`; must be exported, an unset one becomes a folder of that name (README → Optional tracking via matrainer)
